    {
      "kind": "javascript-module",
      "path": "src/components/orc-tabs.ts",
      "declarations": [
        {
          "kind": "class",
          "description": "`<orc-tabs>` implements the WAI-ARIA APG Tabs pattern.\n\nContent API: provide direct child elements marked with `data-tab=\"Label\"`.\nEach marked child becomes a tab panel; its `data-tab` value becomes the\ntab's accessible label. Children are read from light DOM and re-slotted\ninto shadow-rendered tabpanel wrappers so the tab/tabpanel ARIA\nrelationship (aria-controls/aria-labelledby) stays within a single root.\n\n```html\n<orc-tabs selected=\"0\">\n  <div data-tab=\"Overview\">Overview content</div>\n  <div data-tab=\"Details\">Details content</div>\n  <div data-tab=\"Settings\">Settings content</div>\n</orc-tabs>\n```\n\n`selected` accepts either a zero-based index or the tab's label text, and\nis kept in sync with the current selection. A `change` CustomEvent\n(composed, bubbles) fires on selection with `detail: { index, label }`.",
          "name": "OrcTabs",
          "slots": [
            {
              "description": "Elements marked with `data-tab=\"Label\"`, each becoming a tab panel.",
              "name": ""
            }
          ],
          "members": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "change",
              "type": {
                "text": "CustomEvent"
              },
              "description": "`CustomEvent<{ index: number; label: string }>` on selection."
            }
          ],
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "selected",
              "type": {
                "text": "string"
              },
              "description": "Selected tab, as a zero-based index or the tab label."
            }
          ],
          "superclass": {
            "name": "HTMLElementBase",
            "module": "src/components/orc-tabs.ts"
          },
          "tagName": "orc-tabs",
          "customElement": true
        }
      ],
      "exports": [
